msgid ""
"This will delete all messages, files and OMEMO encryption keys for all accounts.\n"
"\n"
"<b>Your accounts will remain, but you will lose all chat history and need to re-verify encryption with your contacts.</b>\n"
"\n"
"DinoX will restart. Enter your current database password after restarting to complete the reset. This action cannot be undone!"
